Master spatial gene map showing the co-localization of Ttr expression with seurat_clusters identity across 2 tissue section(s) in MouseBrain. Each row corresponds to one tissue section and contains four panels: (1) UMAP colored by seurat_clusters clusters, (2) UMAP colored by Ttr log-normalized expression, (3) spatial tissue plot colored by seurat_clusters clusters, and (4) spatial tissue plot colored by Ttr expression on a continuous color scale (dark blue = low, dark red = high). Paired categorical and continuous legends are shown to the right.
